From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: MisterZtr <andey2004586@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 9 Sep 2026 00:00:00 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 11/10] overlay: Enable tap to wake in Settings

GSI menyembunyikan toggle "Tap to wake" di Settings > Display
karena config_supportDoubleTapWake default-nya false.
Aktifkan via file overlay terpisah supaya pengaturannya muncul
tanpa menyentuh config.xml (menghindari konflik dengan patch
0008 dan perubahan upstream).
Nilai aktualnya diteruskan ke Power HAL via
Settings.Secure double_tap_to_wake, jadi fungsi sebenarnya
tetap mengikuti dukungan kernel/vendor (untuk node legacy
Xiaomi/Oppo/Vsmart tetap pakai toggle dt2w di TrebleApp).
---
 .../base/core/res/res/values/config_tap_to_wake.xml | 10 ++++++++++
 1 file changed, 10 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 overlay/frameworks/base/core/res/res/values/config_tap_to_wake.xml

diff --git a/overlay/frameworks/base/core/res/res/values/config_tap_to_wake.xml b/overlay/frameworks/base/core/res/res/values/config_tap_to_wake.xml
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..8f9b6c9
--- /dev/null
+++ b/overlay/frameworks/base/core/res/res/values/config_tap_to_wake.xml
@@ -0,0 +1,9 @@
+<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
+<!--
+SPDX-FileCopyrightText: The LineageOS Project
+SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0
+-->
+<resources>
+    <!-- Enable Tap to wake toggle in Settings > Display for GSI -->
+    <bool name="config_supportDoubleTapWake">true</bool>
+</resources>
--
2.54.0

